input.prompt:
Создай конфигурационные файлы Vue 3 frontend для проекта Luna the Dog.

Все файлы создаются в `frontend/` директории (`/Users/user/github/luna_the_dog/frontend/`).

### 1. `frontend/package.json`
```json
{
  "name": "luna-the-dog-frontend",
  "private": true,
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "type": "module",
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "vite",
    "build": "vite build",
    "preview": "vite preview"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "vue": "^3.5.0",
    "vue-router": "^4.5.0"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@vitejs/plugin-vue": "^5.2.0",
    "autoprefixer": "^10.4.0",
    "daisyui": "^4.12.0",
    "postcss": "^8.4.0",
    "tailwindcss": "^3.4.0",
    "vite": "^6.1.0"
  }
}
```

### 2. `frontend/vite.config.js`
```js
import { defineConfig } from 'vite'
import vue from '@vitejs/plugin-vue'

export default defineConfig({
  plugins: [vue()],
  server: {
    port: 5173,
    proxy: {
      '/api': 'http://localhost:8000',
      '/ws': {
        target: 'ws://localhost:8000',
        ws: true,
      },
    },
  },
})
```

### 3. `frontend/tailwind.config.js`
```js
/** @type {import('tailwindcss').Config} */
export default {
  content: [
    './index.html',
    './src/**/*.{vue,js,ts}',
  ],
  theme: {
    extend: {},
  },
  plugins: [
    require('daisyui'),
  ],
  daisyui: {
    themes: ['light', 'dark'],
  },
}
```

### 4. `frontend/postcss.config.js`
```js
export default {
  plugins: {
    tailwindcss: {},
    autoprefixer: {},
  },
}
```

### 5. `frontend/index.html`
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/vite.svg" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Luna the Dog</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div id="app"></div>
    <script type="module" src="/src/main.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
```

### 6. `frontend/src/main.js`
```js
import { createApp } from 'vue'
import App from './App.vue'
import './style.css'

createApp(App).mount('#app')
```

### 7. `frontend/src/style.css`
```css
@tailwind base;
@tailwind components;
@tailwind utilities;
```

### 8. `frontend/src/App.vue`
```vue
<template>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-base-200">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center p-8">Luna the Dog</h1>
  </div>
</template>
```

Используй Write для создания файлов. Весь нон-код текст на русском.

